        "title": "Mineralogy - Overview and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**5,800 recognized minerals** catalogued by the International Mineralogical Association (IMA). But ~95% of Earth's crust is built from fewer than 20 common minerals."
    },
